# Dependency installations and generated caches
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.npm-cache/

# Local deployment metadata and browser verification profiles
**/.vercel/
**/.chrome-*/

# Generated build and verification output
# Keep docs/ tracked: it is the GitHub Pages deployment directory.
**/dist/
**/artifacts/

# Package manager debug logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Temporary catalog collection files (preserve existing project rules)
**/scripts/*-source.html
**/scripts/*-page-*.html
**/scripts/*-detail-*.html
**/scripts/*-downloads.txt
